{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a image and text section. There should be option to change position like text can be on the left or right side same with the image. In the text it should have headline , body and cta button  then the iamge should be responsive center on the mobile. , below the headline add option to add a 2 seperate text/subheadline with background color and has border radius of 36px., Below the body, add a customer reviews slider. This slider should allow uploading customer reviews, including a highlighted review in bold text. Below the highlighted text, display a 5-star rating (all stars filled). Under the star rating, show the full customer review quote.
    
    Below the quote, display the reviewer’s name, with “Verified Buyer” text beside it and a check badge icon. The slider should include next and previous navigation buttons, as well as centered pagination dots.
    
    The slider must be fully responsive for both mobile and desktop views, with smooth animations that clearly display the customer review content when users click the next or previous arrows., Please fix the responsive layout of the whole image and text section that you creative the mobile version is not responsive please fic it, Please fix the previous arrow , it should be on the left side of the customer reviews container on mobile view, Fix the next and previous button on mobile it should be place at the left and right side of the customer reviews container just like on the desktop view, On mobile view, place the navigation arrows below the customer reviews container. The arrows should be positioned within the dot navigation area, with the pagination dots centered between the previous and next arrows., On desktop view, the next and previous arrows should remain inside the customer review container. On mobile view, the next and previous arrows should be positioned close to the dot navigation, with just enough spacing so they are not too far apart., On desktop view, instead of placing the arrows inside the reviews container, position them within the dot navigation—with the previous arrow, followed by the pagination dots in the center, and the next arrow—matching the same layout used on mobile view., Please add the Button CTA below the customer reviews section, The CTA button below the body , change its position and add below the customer reviews section right below the arrows, Please include an option to adjust the font sizes of the customer review highlighted text, review quote, and author name separately for both mobile and desktop views., Have an option to update the Button text color and background color, The button below the customer reviews arrow , please have an option to update the button color text and button background color
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-image-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-image-text-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-image-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: {{ block.settings.vertical_alignment }};
    gap: {{ block.settings.gap }}px;
    {% if block.settings.layout == 'image_left' %}
      flex-direction: row;
    {% else %}
      flex-direction: row-reverse;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-image-text-image-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 {{ block.settings.image_width }}%;
  }

  .ai-image-text-content-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-image-text-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-image-text-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-image-text-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-image-text-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
  }

  .ai-image-text-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-image-text-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-image-text-subheadlines-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.subheadline_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.subheadline_spacing }}px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    {% if block.settings.text_alignment == 'center' %}
      justify-content: center;
    {% elsif block.settings.text_alignment == 'right' %}
      justify-content: flex-end;
    {% else %}
      justify-content: flex-start;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-image-text-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.subheadline_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.subheadline_padding_horizontal }}px;
    border-radius: 36px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheadline_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-image-text-subheadline-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.subheadline_1_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.subheadline_1_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-image-text-subheadline-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.subheadline_2_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.subheadline_2_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-image-text-body-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.body_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.body_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-image-text-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-image-text-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-reviews-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.slider_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-reviews-slider-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-reviews-slider-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  .ai-review-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    min-width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.review_padding }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.review_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.review_border_radius }}px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .ai-review-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.highlight_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.highlight_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.highlight_spacing }}px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-review-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.stars_spacing }}px;
    {% if block.settings.text_alignment == 'center' %}
      justify-content: center;
    {% elsif block.settings.text_alignment == 'right' %}
      justify-content: flex-end;
    {% else %}
      justify-content: flex-start;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-review-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.star_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.star_size }}px;
    fill: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-review-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.quote_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.quote_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.quote_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-review-author-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.author_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.author_color }};
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    {% if block.settings.text_alignment == 'center' %}
      justify-content: center;
    {% elsif block.settings.text_alignment == 'right' %}
      justify-content: flex-end;
    {% else %}
      justify-content: flex-start;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-review-author-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-review-verified-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    color: {{ block.settings.verified_color }};
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ai-review-check-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    fill: {{ block.settings.verified_color }};
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.nav_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.nav_color }};
    border: 1px solid #cccccc;
    width: {{ block.settings.nav_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.nav_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-slider-nav-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}{
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.nav_hover_bg_color }};
  }

  .ai-slider-nav-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    fill: currentColor;
  }

  .ai-slider-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.pagination_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-slider-dots-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_color }};
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ai-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_active_color }};
  }

  .ai-reviews-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.cta_spacing }}px;
  }

  {% comment %} .ai-reviews-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_font_size }}px;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-reviews-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_hover_text_color }};
  } {% endcomment %}

  .ai-reviews-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_font_size }}px;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-reviews-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_hover_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-reviews-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.6;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .ai-reviews-cta-button-loader-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-reviews-cta-button-loader-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    animation: ai-reviews-cta-spin-{{ ai_gen_id }} 1s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ai-reviews-cta-spin-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  .ai-subheadline-popup-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .ai-subheadline-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .ai-subheadline-popup-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: calc(100% + 14px);
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    width: 258px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    z-index: 3;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ai-subheadline-popup-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-open {
    display: block;
  }

  /* Tail/arrow pointing down */
  .ai-subheadline-popup-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -10px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    border-width: 10px 10px 0 10px;
    border-style: solid;
    border-color: #ffffff transparent transparent transparent;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.08));
  }

  .ai-subheadline-popup-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0 0 0px;
  }

  .ai-subheadline-popup-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #000000;
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: inherit;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-subheadline-popup-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-subheadline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    width: {{ block.settings.subheadline_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.subheadline_icon_size }}px;
    object-fit: contain;
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin-right: 6px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-image-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top | times: 0.6 }}px 0 {{ block.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-image-text-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 16px;
    }

    .ai-image-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-image-text-image-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 100%;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-image-text-content-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-image-text-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .ai-image-text-subheadlines-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .ai-image-text-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_spacing | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-image-text-body-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.body_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.body_spacing | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-image-text-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subheadline_font_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.subheadline_padding_vertical | times: 0.8 }}px {{ block.settings.subheadline_padding_horizontal | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-reviews-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.slider_spacing | times: 0.8 }}px;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .ai-review-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.review_padding | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-review-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.highlight_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.highlight_spacing | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-review-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.quote_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.quote_spacing | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-review-author-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.author_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-review-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.star_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.star_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.nav_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.nav_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .ai-review-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-review-author-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .ai-reviews-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.cta_spacing | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-reviews-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_padding_vertical | times: 0.9 }}px {{ block.settings.reviews_cta_padding_horizontal | times: 0.9 }}px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
     .ai-subheadline-popup-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 191px;
      padding: 16px 12px 6px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
     .ai-subheadline-popup-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin: 0 0 0px;
    }
    .ai-subheadline-popup-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
    .ai-image-text-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-image-text-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subheadline_font_size | times: 0.75 }}px;
    }

    .ai-subheadline-popup-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      left: 56%;
    }
  }

  .ai-amazon-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background-color: {{ block.settings.amazon_btn_bg_color }};
  color: #ffffff;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 13px 40px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  width: {{ block.settings.amazon_btn_width }}%;
  max-width: 100%;
  transition: background-color 0.2s;
}

.ai-amazon-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} strong {
  color: #ffffff;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1;
}

.ai-amazon-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.ai-amazon-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
  opacity: 0.88;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
  .ai-amazon-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px 20px;
  }
}
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-image-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-image-text-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-image-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-image-text-image-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-image-text-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-image-text-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-image-text-content-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-image-text-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
            <h2 class="ai-image-text-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
          {% endif %}

          {% comment %} {% if block.settings.subheadline_1 != blank or block.settings.subheadline_2 != blank %}
            <div class="ai-image-text-subheadlines-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.subheadline_1 != blank %}
                <span class="ai-image-text-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-image-text-subheadline-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.subheadline_1 }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if block.settings.subheadline_2 != blank %}
                <span class="ai-image-text-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-image-text-subheadline-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.subheadline_2 }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %} {% endcomment %}

          {% if block.settings.subheadline_1 != blank or block.settings.subheadline_2 != blank %}
            <div class="ai-image-text-subheadlines-{{ ai_gen_id }}">

              {% if block.settings.subheadline_1 != blank %}
                <div class="ai-subheadline-popup-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <span class="ai-image-text-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-image-text-subheadline-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-subheadline-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-popup="subheadline-popup-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    {% if block.settings.subheadline_1_popup_text == blank %}style="cursor:default"{% endif %}
                  >
                    {% if block.settings.subheadline_1_icon %}
                      <img
                        src="{{ block.settings.subheadline_1_icon | image_url: width: 40 }}"
                        alt=""
                        class="ai-subheadline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                        width="20"
                        height="20"
                      >
                    {% endif %}
                    {{ block.settings.subheadline_1 }}
                  </span>
                  {% if block.settings.subheadline_1_popup_text != blank %}
                    <div class="ai-subheadline-popup-{{ ai_gen_id }}" id="subheadline-popup-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
